21|VMware, Inc.|2013-08-22|Y|N|N|Jonathan Chadwick, Chief Financial Officer and Executive Vice President (ceased serving as principal accounting officer on Kevan Krysler's appointment, 2013-08-19)|Y|N|CANDIDATE FOR ADJUDICATION. The relinquishment is implicit: the text says Mr. Chadwick 'also served as principal accounting officer prior to Mr. Krysler's appointment'. Principal accounting officer is an enumerated covered title, so round-1 rule 2 (leaving a covered title while remaining employed) gives Y. A reader could code N on the ground that the filing reports an appointment, not a departure. [VERIFIED] PARTLY. Krysler CONFIRMED as VMware's Chief Accounting Officer and Senior Vice President from 2013-08-19. That Chadwick thereby ceased to be principal accounting officer rests on the filing's own wording and is NOT independently confirmed. Code unchanged (Y); row stays FLAGGED.
