28|Altice USA, Inc.|2018-06-13|N|N|N||N|N|CANDIDATE FOR ADJUDICATION. The board was increased from seven to nine (+2) yet THREE directors were appointed 'to fill the resulting vacancies', so one seat appears to have come from a departure the text does not report. No departure is stated, so coded N; the round-2 ruling that vacancy mentions count for directors could be read to make this Y. [VERIFIED] NOT CONFIRMED. No reachable non-SEC source names a director who resigned or left the Altice USA board in connection with the June 2018 separation. Code unchanged (N); row stays FLAGGED.
